PROJECT BRIEF
Build a complete, production-quality Flutter Android application called HydroFit — a gym and fitness companion app. It is offline-first, no login, no backend, no cloud. All user data persists locally via SQLite. All exercise/meal content is hardcoded in the app. All exercise GIFs are bundled as Flutter assets.

Target platform: Android only (do not target iOS, web, or desktop).
Flutter: 3.47.9 stable, Dart 3.x.
Environment: Windows 11 host, Android SDK 36, physical device or AVD available.

CORE ARCHITECTURE REQUIREMENTS
No authentication, no backend, no network calls except launching YouTube links via url_launcher.

State management: Use provider (simple, well-documented, appropriate for app this size). Do not introduce Riverpod/Bloc unless the agent has a strong reason.

Local database: sqflite + path. Only the Schedule feature uses the DB. Training and Diet content are hardcoded Dart constants.

Navigation: BottomNavigationBar with 4 persistent tabs: Training, Diet, Schedule, Account. Each tab preserves its scroll state (use IndexedStack or PageStorageKey).

Theming: Support light and dark mode; user selection persisted via shared_preferences.

Notifications: flutter_local_notifications with timezone support (timezone package). Requires core library desugaring enabled in android/app/build.gradle.

